 },
 "description": "Free anonymous non-blocking self-report of wallet, mandate, x402 v2, network, asset, account kind and funding readiness. Detects EVM account types incompatible with exact EIP-3009 before signature. Stores only a daily pseudonymous actor and normalized reason; never a wallet, balance, signature or request content.",
